{"anchor": {"begin": [1, 0, 632.12], "end": [1, 0, 641.82], "file": "toy.tex", "kind": "approximate", "line": 75}, "blockers": [], "class": "out-of-scope", "clauses": [], "context_tex": "\\begin{proof}\nFix $n$. By Theorem~\\ref{thm:triangle},\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:bound-sum}\n  2\\,T_n = n^2 + n.\n\\end{equation}\nFor every natural number $k \\ge 0$,\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:bound-range}\n  n \\le k\\,n^2,\n\\end{equation}\nand the choice $k = 1$ in \\eqref{eq:bound-range} gives $2T_n \\le 2n^2$, so $C = 1$ works.", "decls": {"Toy.Acceptance.thm_bound": "b0da0e5d856730342280fc15", "Toy.PaperSpec.thm_bound": "3bb78650aaf9f75cb8ba83ff", "Toy.triangle": "cdc34e92c5b0188526ab2d8b", "Toy.triangle._f": "b3d7b36a57b3e2427d1e8f84", "Toy.triangle.match_1": "b0a5f4e0c978119057627d50"}, "excerpt": {"blocks": [{"p": [{"text": "For every natural number "}, {"math": "k \\ge 0"}, {"text": ","}]}, {"display": true, "math": "\\begin{equation*} n \\le k\\,n^2, \\tag{3}\\end{equation*}"}], "body_style": null, "cites": {}, "end_column": 15, "end_line": 78, "file": "toy.tex", "fingerprint": "tex-excerpt-v1:6e040ba6569d712ff6a83267542292e10ace4b4ef8b3bbf3e12c875e4c8d4379", "kind": "span", "macros": {}, "ready": true, "reasons": [], "refs": {"eq:bound-range": "3"}, "revision": null, "scheme": "tex-excerpt-v1", "selector": null, "start_column": 1, "start_line": 75, "text": "For every natural number $k \\ge 0$,\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:bound-range}\n  n \\le k\\,n^2,\n\\end{equation}"}, "findings": [], "id": "T:eq:bound-range", "kind": "equation", "location": "toy.tex:75", "number": "Equation (3)", "paper": "T", "parent": "T:thm:bound", "release": "r-a2ba621631ae", "schema": "prooflens/manifest@1", "scope": "proof-step", "scope_note": "a step of the proof of Theorem 2.5", "scope_reviewed": true, "source_evidence": {"placement": "approximate", "state": "pass"}, "source_matches": true, "source_sha256": "4640c8e3da3aba8d9a9e58abd761bf9c41ec8d0bafd25609f0d143cf9f3e62ef", "statement_tex": "For every natural number $k \\ge 0$,\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:bound-range}\n  n \\le k\\,n^2,\n\\end{equation}", "status": "out of scope: proof-step", "status_code": "scope.proof-step", "step": {"correspondence": null, "links": [], "parent": {"file": "T_thm_bound-c82142db.json", "heading": null, "id": "T:thm:bound", "number": "Theorem 2.5", "title": "Uniform bound"}, "review": {"finding": {"current": true, "file": "reviews/T.md", "line": 62, "reviewer": {"author": false, "id": "a.referee", "identity": "self-declared", "kind": "human"}, "source_sha256": "4640c8e3da3aba8d9a9e58abd761bf9c41ec8d0bafd25609f0d143cf9f3e62ef", "state": "false", "text": "A review of the printed step, not of Theorem 2.5. The step reads: for every natural number\n`k >= 0` (with `n` fixed at the start of the proof), `n <= k n^2`. At `k = 0` and `n = 1` it\nreads `1 <= 0`, which is false. It holds for every `k >= 1`, since `n <= n^2 <= k n^2`, and the\nnext line of the proof uses only `k = 1`; restricting the printed range to `k >= 1` repairs the\nstep, and Theorem 2.5 is unaffected.\n\nVerdict: false as printed.", "verdict": {"detail": "", "value": "false as printed"}}, "reports": [{"current": true, "file": "reviews/T.md", "line": 62, "reviewer": {"author": false, "id": "a.referee", "identity": "self-declared", "kind": "human"}, "source_sha256": "4640c8e3da3aba8d9a9e58abd761bf9c41ec8d0bafd25609f0d143cf9f3e62ef", "state": "false", "text": "A review of the printed step, not of Theorem 2.5. The step reads: for every natural number\n`k >= 0` (with `n` fixed at the start of the proof), `n <= k n^2`. At `k = 0` and `n = 1` it\nreads `1 <= 0`, which is false. It holds for every `k >= 1`, since `n <= n^2 <= k n^2`, and the\nnext line of the proof uses only `k = 1`; restricting the printed range to `k >= 1` repairs the\nstep, and Theorem 2.5 is unaffected.\n\nVerdict: false as printed.", "verdict": {"detail": "", "value": "false as printed"}}], "state": "false"}, "route": {"by": "human:A-